            "streetviewpublish.photo.update": "Street View Publish needs both this product's API key and a Google OAuth 2.0 access token with the streetviewpublish scope. Call auth_login for the Street View credential route first; until the scope is granted this tool is hidden. photo.startUpload only opens an upload session; uploading bytes is not implemented.",
            "streetviewpublish.photoSequence.create": "Street View Publish needs both this product's API key and a Google OAuth 2.0 access token with the streetviewpublish scope. Call auth_login for the Street View credential route first; until the scope is granted this tool is hidden. photo.startUpload only opens an upload session; uploading bytes is not implemented.",
            "streetviewpublish.photoSequence.delete": "Street View Publish needs both this product's API key and a Google OAuth 2.0 access token with the streetviewpublish scope. Call auth_login for the Street View credential route first; until the scope is granted this tool is hidden. photo.startUpload only opens an upload session; uploading bytes is not implemented.",
            "streetviewpublish.photoSequence.get": "Street View Publish needs both this product's API key and a Google OAuth 2.0 access token with the streetviewpublish scope. Call auth_login for the Street View credential route first; until the scope is granted this tool is hidden. photo.startUpload only opens an upload session; uploading bytes is not implemented.",
            "streetviewpublish.photoSequence.startUpload": "Street View Publish needs both this product's API key and a Google OAuth 2.0 access token with the streetviewpublish scope. Call auth_login for the Street View credential route first; until the scope is granted this tool is hidden. photo.startUpload only opens an upload session; uploading bytes is not implemented.",
